      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-04T13:49:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1. I see no reason why need to enforce disabling SVM at compile time, if the host can just detect that it is not supported at runtime.",
      "parentUuid": "98d96f1e_3e1eb5a4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 139,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 139,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "db040a4cb7cb7460fdd84701422c3a1048a9cb29",
